    "sections": {
        "description": "The Tutor E-learning Theme is a versatile and powerful solution designed for tutors, private tutoring, online tutoring, virtual sessions, elementary tutors, middle school tutors, high school tutors, college tutors, university tutors, test prep, SAT tutoring, ACT tutoring, college prep, homework help, e-learning platforms, online courses, digital education, training platforms, educational websites, learning management systems, virtual classrooms, professional development, course creation, academic portals, skill development, knowledge sharing, tutor websites, learning tools, education technology, study skills development, special needs education, and gifted education. With a modern, clean, and professional layout, this theme provides an engaging user experience while allowing tutors to showcase their qualifications, experience, and services to build credibility. Its user-friendly interface supports one-on-one or group tutoring, in-home or virtual sessions, and personalized academic coaching. Fully responsive and retina-ready, the theme ensures seamless access across devices. Customization options allow colors, fonts, and layouts to align with your brand, while integration with plugins like LearnPress enables course management, online quizzes, and student enrollment, making it easy to run a complete e-learning platform. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/tutor-elearning/"
    },
